<span class="lini-tok-comment">// The built-in named-hue palette (SPEC §11.2): 11 hues × 5 tiers, plus a few</span>
<span class="lini-tok-comment">// &quot;pretty card&quot; combinations (wash fill + ink stroke/text) showing the easy path.</span>
